For those who improved their scores 
as well as those who didn't,

00:16:44.160 --> 00:16:46.400
these third-year proficiency tests

00:16:46.400 --> 00:16:49.140
will be indispensable in guiding 
you through the coming year.

00:16:49.140 --> 00:16:50.940
Use them to identify your weaknesses

00:16:50.940 --> 00:16:53.030
and make them work for you.

00:16:58.440 --> 00:17:01.200
Three melon buns and two 
chocolate twist buns, please!

00:17:01.200 --> 00:17:04.200
You need to take in a little more protein!

00:17:04.200 --> 00:17:05.870
Uh, okay, then a yakisoba b—

00:17:05.870 --> 00:17:06.860
Here's a hot dog!

00:17:10.990 --> 00:17:15.510
Porky, you're the only one 
I can talk to about this...

00:17:16.630 --> 00:17:19.260
Number one overall in maths and sciences?

00:17:19.580 --> 00:17:22.200
Whoa, you did it, Desktomu!

00:17:23.310 --> 00:17:24.890
Is Mashima gonna be okay?

00:17:25.880 --> 00:17:28.220
Is Mashima gonna be okay?

00:17:28.220 --> 00:17:31.580
His mom won't make him quit 
the karuta club, will she?

00:17:32.150 --> 00:17:41.160
<b>Once-in-a-lifetime
chance!!</b>

00:17:32.150 --> 00:17:41.160
<b>Can't stand her</b>

00:17:32.960 --> 00:17:38.060
W-Well, Desktomu, if that happens, 
the whole club will oppose her!

00:17:38.060 --> 00:17:40.110
Whether it means going on 
strike or groveling or...

00:17:40.110 --> 00:17:41.150
Hey, you two.

00:17:42.270 --> 00:17:44.030
Can I talk to you about something?

00:17:45.540 --> 00:17:47.370
Club Demonstrations for New Students 
1. Greetings from the head of each year 
2. Introduction of clubs 
Tennis club     Soccer club 
Archery club     Competitive karuta club 
Mountain climbing club     Table tennis club 
Baseball club     Broadcasting club 
