00:17:48.880 --> 00:17:50.090
It'll be fine.

00:17:50.090 --> 00:17:52.610
Let's just stay calm and follow the script.

00:17:52.610 --> 00:17:53.300
Right.

00:17:54.170 --> 00:17:55.550
<b>So beautiful...</b>

00:17:56.790 --> 00:17:58.720
Wait... where's Taichi?

00:17:59.200 --> 00:18:01.050
Oh, Ayase-san, one moment.

00:18:05.080 --> 00:18:07.940
I'm sorry to do this right now,

00:18:08.500 --> 00:18:10.310
but I need to revise your script.

00:18:10.310 --> 00:18:11.110
The Mizusawa Karuta Club was formed three years ago.
 We have five third-year and two second-year members.
 Last year, we fought our way through a tough battle to win...

00:18:11.110 --> 00:18:13.820
The Mizusawa Karuta Club was formed three years ago.
 We have four third-year and two second-year members.
 Last year, we fought our way through a tough battle to win...

00:18:13.820 --> 00:18:15.820
four third-year

00:18:19.340 --> 00:18:22.590
Mashima-kun submitted a 
request to leave the club.

00:18:23.250 --> 00:18:25.810
He said he wants to focus on 
studying for entrance exams.

00:18:29.420 --> 00:18:32.020
And that was the soccer club's demo!

00:18:32.020 --> 00:18:33.420
We're looking for a female manager!

00:18:33.910 --> 00:18:39.740
Next up is the club that has won the club 
relay at our athletic festival two years in a row,

00:18:34.470 --> 00:18:36.040
<i>He requested to leave?</i>

00:18:37.020 --> 00:18:38.680
Mashima-senpai...

00:18:39.740 --> 00:18:42.480
the club that leads the school in its 
balance of academics and athletics...

00:18:42.480 --> 00:18:44.810
The competitive karuta club!

00:18:43.170 --> 00:18:44.700
Ayase, we'll take your place!

00:18:44.700 --> 00:18:45.680
Just stay there!

00:18:48.750 --> 00:18:51.340
We're the competitive karuta club!

00:18:50.840 --> 00:18:52.470
She's cute...

00:18:50.850 --> 00:18:52.290
She's gorgeous!

00:18:52.290 --> 00:18:54.900
He just described us as 
both academic and athletic,

00:18:54.900 --> 00:18:57.670
but if anything, I'd say we're 
lacking a bit on the academic side.

00:18:58.580 --> 00:19:02.480
Competitive karuta is a sport that
emphasizes explosiveness and fast reflexes.

00:19:02.480 --> 00:19:06.060
Last year, we actually won 
the national championship.

00:19:06.060 --> 00:19:08.120
Wow, awesome!

00:19:08.120 --> 00:19:12.260
Our six second-year and third-year 
members are still working hard...

00:19:25.170 --> 00:19:26.050
Huh?

00:19:26.980 --> 00:19:28.140
What's wrong?

00:19:33.760 --> 00:19:35.270
I'll continue.

00:19:35.270 --> 00:19:37.740
The true appeal of competitive karuta

00:19:37.740 --> 00:19:40.860
is its focus on the Ogura Hundred Poets.

00:19:41.260 --> 00:19:43.420
Poems that have survived 
for a thousand years,

00:19:43.420 --> 00:19:46.870
that sing of joy, sorrow, and love...

00:19:47.580 --> 00:19:50.690
are laid out before you in all their glory.

00:19:51.150 --> 00:19:54.650
We would love to share their 
magnificence with you.

00:20:02.260 --> 00:20:03.390
Taichi!

00:20:04.400 --> 00:20:05.420
Taichi!

00:20:05.420 --> 00:20:07.130
Don't, Taichi!

00:20:07.130 --> 00:20:09.240
Don't do it! Don't quit the club!

00:20:09.240 --> 00:20:11.350
Don't do it, Taichi!

00:20:11.350 --> 00:20:13.490
Taichi!

00:20:38.080 --> 00:20:39.190
Chihaya...

00:20:40.580 --> 00:20:42.160
Do you think...

00:20:43.760 --> 00:20:46.250
I'm made of stone or something?

00:20:58.010 --> 00:21:00.340
I can't play karuta.

00:21:01.450 --> 00:21:02.510
Right now...

00:21:03.870 --> 00:21:05.530
all hundred cards

00:21:06.200 --> 00:21:07.910
look pitch-black to me.

00:21:12.290 --> 00:21:13.290
All of them.

00:21:16.090 --> 00:21:17.150
All of them.

00:21:20.250 --> 00:21:21.220
All of them.

00:21:24.800 --> 00:21:25.140
<i>I do not know where this love will take me</i>
